WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.634
-Performing "2010"
from his new album, "Sick,"

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:06.234
give it up for Earl Sweatshirt.

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:08.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:09.801
♪♪

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:10.934
[Rapping] ♪ Huh ♪

00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:12.534
♪ I'm-a need a bigger bag
for the cohort ♪

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:14.968
♪ Tryna make a millionaire out
of slum dogs ♪

00:00:14.968 --> 00:00:16.734
♪ Bet that, head crack,
blunt force ♪

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:19.067
♪ Cozy with the east Africans
up north ♪

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:21.434
♪ Seven make a three,
turn a ten by law ♪

00:00:21.434 --> 00:00:23.767
♪ Crescent moon wink,
when I blinked it was gone ♪

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:25.868
♪ Left the crib, smacked,
no sheath on the sword ♪

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:28.267
♪ Made it by the skin
of my teeth, thank God ♪

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.267
♪ '03, momma rockin'
Liz Claiborne ♪

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:32.701
♪ Had her stressin' up the wall
playin' Mary J. songs ♪

00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:34.901
♪ Rainy day came,
couldn't rinse the stains off ♪

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:37.267
♪ Long way to go,
we already came far ♪

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:39.667
♪ Story stayed the same,
it was never made up ♪

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:42.000
♪ Threw me loose change,
look at what I made of it ♪

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.934
♪ When the mood change,
I'ma poker-face 'em ♪

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:46.400
♪ It's a new day,
who got all the aces? ♪

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.667
♪ Who be foldin' late?
Who know when to play dead? ♪

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:51.000
♪ Who sit up straight
when the roof caved in? ♪

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.200
♪ Had a full plate,
you ain't wanna split it ♪

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.734
♪ Tell it to you straight,
you ain't wanna listen ♪

00:00:55.734 --> 00:00:57.467
♪ Cup runneth over the brim ♪

00:00:57.467 --> 00:00:59.634
♪ Bust open,
there's no closin' the lid ♪

00:00:59.634 --> 00:01:02.133
♪ Drumroll,
here go my lil' entrance ♪

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:04.300
♪ Gung ho,
I'm the one that go get it ♪

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.701
♪ Five O's on me
like the Olympics ♪

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:08.834
♪ Pure gold, somethin' told me,
"Don't mix it" ♪

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:11.167
♪ Caught a feelin', momma had me
out Temple ♪

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:13.601
♪ Not religious, we was really
out Philly ♪

00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:15.868
♪ Livin' on the fly
tryna wing it ♪

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:18.300
♪ We got us a fire to rekindle ♪

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.467
♪ Redirect the fight
where it's meant for ♪

00:01:20.467 --> 00:01:22.734
♪ Triumph over plight
and immense loss ♪

00:01:22.734 --> 00:01:25.067
♪ Ride alone at night,
I get clear thoughts ♪

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:27.267
♪ Caught a couple slights
and I veered off ♪

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:29.501
♪ Saw another height,
had my ears poppin' ♪

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:31.801
♪ Walked outside,
it was still gorgeous ♪

00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:34.033
♪ Sharp incisors reveal slowly ♪

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:36.167
♪ In the dark inside,
we was real hungry ♪

00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:39.701
♪ On a seven of the five,
we was real hungry ♪

00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:41.000
♪ We still drummin' ♪

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.133
♪ Foot shook ground
when I stepped on it ♪

00:01:43.133 --> 00:01:45.400
♪ Didn't look back
when I broke soil ♪

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.667
♪ 'Cause every time I did it
would hurt more ♪

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:49.767
♪ In the dark inside,
we was real hungry ♪

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:52.133
♪ On a seven of the five,
we was real hungry ♪

00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:54.667
♪ And I didn't look back
when I broke soil ♪

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:56.801
♪ 'Cause every time I did it
would hurt more ♪

00:01:56.801 --> 00:01:59.834
♪♪

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:02.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

